>! tav 1.0
>! target text
>#  Plain.tav — the reply when the model is unavailable, or phrased the decision into a promise.
>#
>#  NO MODEL, SO NOTHING TO CHECK. Every sentence below is a norm Policy.hs derived, in its policy's own wording,
>#  and the assistant is exactly as correct without a language model as with one — only less warm.
> if .uncovered:
    No written policy decides this request for booking {{ .reference }}, so I can't promise anything. An agent will review it and contact you.
> else:
    > for norm in .forbidden:
        For booking {{ .reference }} I can't offer {{ norm.what }}. {{ norm.text }}
    > for norm in .obliged:
        For booking {{ .reference }} you can have {{ norm.what }}. {{ norm.text }}
